<title>USA: Shaw Industries Sept 30 Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Shaw Industries Sept 30 Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALTON, Ga. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.18		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net		 24,179		   21,905</p>
<p> Sales	     881,506		  748,364</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  137,173		  136,391</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.27		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net		 36,694		   32,978</p>
<p> Sales	     2,324,983		2,163,240</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  136,411		  136,389</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Shaw Industries Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share for the nine months ended Sept 30 1995 include a $0.09 per share loss for an accounting change. During the first quarter 1996, the company recorded nonrecurring charges of $26.5 million or $0.19 per share after taxes for the reduction of the carrying value of certain goodwill and property, plant and equipment and a provision for the disposal of certain other assets.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
